      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "HU Hsü 胡煦 (T. 滄曉, H. 紫弦), 1655–1736, Oct. 17, scholar and official, was a native of Kuang-shan, Honan. Although he became a chü-jên in 1684, he did not succeed in obtaining his chin-shih until 1712 at the rather advanced age of fifty-eight (sui).",
